"▏ Thought for 4s                                                                                                        "
"  ⎿  The manifest first, because the lockfile only says what the manifest already asked for.                            "
"     Then the crate map, which is the one place the layering is written down.                                           "
"     The plan after that: it says which of the two is allowed to move.                                                  "
"     Only then the code, and only the file the plan names.                                                              "
"     Anything else is a second reading of the same three facts.                                                         "
"     So: manifest, map, plan.                                                                                           "
